deo></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is played in Real-Time Online along side your pets, so good planning,  mechanical skill and a fateful meeting with the right partner are necessary to be the best. Over 32 Attacks in the demo, each with complex physics interactions with other moves and the environment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/3805bbc8e22d6d3187223647cc2018b7.poster.avif?t=1781005858\" width=780 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/3805bbc8e22d6d3187223647cc2018b7.webm?t=1781005858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/3805bbc8e22d6d3187223647cc2018b7.mp4?t=1781005858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way to the top you'll meet other trainers with similar ambitions. You'll also meet powerful pets and uncover their role in the fabric of UltraSpace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/1f4a42c5e8697cebc4f003c237e85899.poster.avif?t=1781005858\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/1f4a42c5e8697cebc4f003c237e85899.webm?t=1781005858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877480/extras/1f4a42c5e8697cebc4f003c237e85899.mp4?t=1781005858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "UltraPets is a Creature Collecting Online RPG with Exciting real-time physics based combat and uniqu